---
import {priceGroups,hotel,yen,bookingUrls} from '../data/hotel';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="price section-pad" id="price"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow"><span>02</span> PRICE</p><h2>ご宿泊料金</h2></div><p class="section-aside">お部屋を選んで、<br />ご滞在の計画を。</p></div><div class="price-table" data-reveal><div class="price-table-head"><span>客室</span><span>平日料金</span><span>週末料金</span></div>{priceGroups.map(group=><div class="price-group"><div class="price-rooms"><small>ROOM</small><p>{group.rooms.join(' / ')}</p><div class="price-booking-links" aria-label="この料金グループの客室を予約">{group.rooms.map(number=><a href={bookingUrls[number as keyof typeof bookingUrls]} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${number}号室をAirbnbで予約する（新しいタブ）`}>{number}を予約 <Icon name="arrow" /></a>)}</div></div><div class="price-amount"><span class="mobile-label">平日料金</span><p>{yen(group.weekday)}<small>円</small></p></div><div class="price-amount"><span class="mobile-label">週末料金</span><p>{yen(group.weekend)}<small>円</small></p></div></div>)}</div><div class="price-conditions"><div class="price-included"><p class="eyebrow">FOR YOUR STAY</p><h3>2名様までの料金です。<br />最大4名様でご利用いただけます。</h3></div><dl><div><dt>3名様以上のご利用</dt><dd>追加1名様につき1泊 <strong>{yen(hotel.extraGuest)}<small>円</small></strong></dd></div><div><dt>清掃費</dt><dd>1予約・1グループあたり <strong>{yen(hotel.cleaning)}<small>円</small></strong></dd></div></dl></div></div></section>
